IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MULTISCALE-CHUNK.

DATA DIVISION.
01 GPU-UTIL-PCT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 QUEUE-LEN           PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 CHUNK-SIZE          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 BATCHED-REQS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-MULTISCALE-CHUNK.
    IF GPU-UTIL-PCT > 80
        MOVE 256 TO CHUNK-SIZE.
    ELSE
        MOVE 1024 TO CHUNK-SIZE.
    END-IF.

    IF QUEUE-LEN < 32
        MOVE QUEUE-LEN TO BATCHED-REQS.
    ELSE
        MOVE 32 TO BATCHED-REQS.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 CHUNK-SIZE.
    WEIGHT 30 BATCHED-REQS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
